    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=21$",
      "worked": "Each lamb has 4 legs, so the equation is $4(x+4)=100$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}4x+16&=100\\\\4x&=84\\\\x&=21\\end{align*}$$\n\nThere were originally 21 lambs.",
